{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "22caf34f68f67ba07cb94af99913ce120b2318a8376f9e1ceec558767f62054f", "ja": "（美奈子の新曲のPV撮影が始まったが、初日は\nOKが出ないまま終わった。今日の調子は……）", "zh": "（美奈子新歌的PV拍摄开始了，但第一天在没能通过的情况下结束了。今天状态怎么样呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "b85906f162026159048e8699025d269ce5556201bd76a08e5c4421f9aa618ba0", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまですっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1002_p", "source_sha256": "52aaec6a4596360734e44c324a2d89be0fdfbbad4ca575ca21840b1595f861a4", "ja": "美奈子、お疲れさま。\n仕事の後なのに、元気いっぱいだな！", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦了。\n明明工作结束了，还是精力满满啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "aa1874de546828eeeaec6d59718eb0d1064446ec90ac23bfcb0277257fba7312", "ja": "はいっ！\n今日は上手くできたから、うれしくて。", "zh": "是！\n因为今天完成得很顺利，所以特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "89a360bbb5a9d503986827c0da164a723bd0c62d46ef915712f656b81eac8954", "ja": "えっと、もう大丈夫です！\n私なりの愛情の届け方、バッチリです！", "zh": "那个，已经没问题了！\n我找到属于自己的表达爱意方式，完美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1005_p", "source_sha256": "8f5bcde3e872b08ffba77adca9fcf3c5c92abe12d077fd5bacb48a46c1ff8573", "ja": "バッチリか。\nってことは、もう悩みは解決したのか？", "zh": "“完美”吗？也就是说，你已经解决烦恼了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "d70f6f9bb98fba882fc990d45fd4226069b7a924af3264da1f1c637f6e0e7a69", "ja": "はい。私、ずっと考えてたんです……。このPVで\n一番表現したい『愛情』って何だろう？って。", "zh": "是的。我一直在思考……这个PV最想表达的“爱”究竟是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "d0448fcc8c10c78f6db9056914300bcfcf13aa8a1cc42d3d54bd927ceab5903f", "ja": "でも、考えても答えが見つからなくて……。\n気分転換しようと思って、お店を手伝ってたんです。", "zh": "可是，想来想去还是找不到答案……于是我想换换心情，就来帮忙看店了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ad0fb12e8f004a01107e1129d43447b6ed135997e2d063ec6734121c66224436", "ja": "気分転換がお店の手伝いか。\n美奈子らしい方法だな。", "zh": "用帮忙经营店铺来转换心情吗？真像美奈子的做法啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "81a20c9efc9ebaaa2179e725eb452ee2ba5e111643c00d559184ca3ab9e2c3d9", "ja": "えへへっ♪　そうしたら、「何か悩んでる？」って、\n常連のおじいちゃんに言われたんです。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪　然后，常来的老爷爷问我：“你是不是有什么烦恼？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "73a357ec774a6d8148175cbdc632481dfea53d5d93bb365ed6508639090e73d8", "ja": "どうしてか聞いたら、「いつもより元気がない」って。\n私は、いつもどおりのつもりだったのに。", "zh": "我问他为什么，他说“你比平时没精神”。可我明明觉得自己和平时一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d83d71cc128df0aa96bb576e951abb7b78ccd6b106a1e8739b0d195970deba31", "ja": "常連さんは小さい頃から美奈子を見ていたから、\n小さな変化にも気づいたのかもしれないな。", "zh": "熟客们是从小看着美奈子长大的，\n所以可能连小小的变化都能察觉到吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "e579da05d449c6a3457caa1576a511ae1c3a733b8b9f547508608abac2c909f3", "ja": "そうだと思います。……家族や仲間以外にも、\n私を気にかけてくれる人が、たくさんいるんですよね。", "zh": "我也觉得是这样。……除了家人和伙伴以外，还有很多一直关心着我的人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "f372c8fda3b38536df93caef5a9d029dc5fb93b1596bca4033614445325817a5", "ja": "だから私も、みんなへの感謝やお礼の気持ちを\n乗せられたら、もっと届けられるのかなって。", "zh": "所以我也在想，要是能把对大家的感谢和感激之情寄托在其中，是不是就能传达得更多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1014_p", "source_sha256": "10048a34a11281e270964775322b0595e1e4f9dd214da605b677892e1b889630", "ja": "気持ちをもらって、気持ちを返す……。\nうん、素敵な考え方だと思うよ。", "zh": "收到这份心意，再将心意回馈给对方……  \n嗯，我觉得这是个很棒的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "fe2b67ef24ab21a2aa7f1af5957dc82dd016b6fc7e8013ef31233ef529e558ea", "ja": "ありがとうございます。このPVで、\n私の愛情、たっぷり届けられるといいなぁ……。", "zh": "谢谢您。希望能通过这支PV，把我满满的爱传达给大家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1016_019min", "source_sha256": "ba5a2fc2ea60b63fee0870fcfec0b9ce9f60d64d3d29d9376690ceff6e198da9", "ja": "それで、応援してくれる人たちみんなを、\n私の愛でいっぱいにしちゃいます！", "zh": "这样一来，就要用我的爱填满所有支持我的人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0284_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "175322445c5bf6ac5be5df4fddb0a0056fc5cd27b9828ce0230c46cedc71a21d", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}さんもですよ！\n私からのサービスで、特盛りの愛をお届けしますね♪", "zh": "当然也包括{$P$}先生！\n我会用特别服务，为您送上满满的爱哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
